<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A Rebuilding Year</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra and Adora were everything to each other, but then Adora chose to move from Horde Rowing to Bright Moon Rowing Club and a major miscommunication left Catra too upset to follow. After barely speaking for the past two years, a well-timed picture of the two of them is threatening to cause a scandal. With few options, they'll have to pretend to be dating to quiet the media. Can the two of them navigate what went wrong two years ago and rebuild their old relationship, or is what they once had permanently lost?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(Aka the rowing fake dating AU that nobody asked for but I wrote anyways)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>auspicious_shipss</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
